以下是有筛选条件的URL：
curl 'https://skypt.gdcic.net/api/openplatform/project/list?projectName=%E5%BA%93%E5%9D%91%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E5%9B%AD%E6%95%B4%E4%BD%93%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B&cityId=440300&orgName=%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%B8%82%E8%AF%9A%E4%BF%A1%E8%A1%8C%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%92%A8%E8%AF%A2%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8&projectClassId=1&projectCode=4403101511260102&kaptcha=VZYEU&pageNum=1&pageSize=10&kaptchaKey=smWiMJGKWSniPct3a6Y__lkdNLHdXdVmPDAXJy_u&flag=true' \
  -H 'Accept: application/json, text/plain, */*' \
  -H 'Accept-Language: zh-CN,zh;q=0.9' \
  -H 'Cache-Control: no-cache' \
  -H 'Connection: keep-alive' \
  -H 'Pragma: no-cache' \
  -H 'Referer: https://skypt.gdcic.net/' \
  -H 'Sec-Fetch-Dest: empty' \
  -H 'Sec-Fetch-Mode: cors' \
  -H 'Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin' \
  -H 'User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36' \
  -H 'sec-ch-ua: "Not;A=Brand";v="8", "Chromium";v="150", "Google Chrome";v="150"' \
  -H 'sec-ch-ua-mobile: ?0' \
  -H 'sec-ch-ua-platform: "Windows"'
  
  projectName对应项目名称，cityId对应所在市，orgName对应建设单位，projectClassId对应项目分类，projectCode对应省级项目编号，kaptcha对应验证码
  
  以下是无筛选条件的URL：
  curl 'https://skypt.gdcic.net/api/openplatform/project/list?kaptcha=YSKFG&pageNum=1&pageSize=10&kaptchaKey=Go0kMgaYcOo76RvZfNW5jInLYAks1TNR07OhFaMF&flag=true' \
  -H 'Accept: application/json, text/plain, */*' \
  -H 'Accept-Language: zh-CN,zh;q=0.9' \
  -H 'Cache-Control: no-cache' \
  -H 'Connection: keep-alive' \
  -H 'Pragma: no-cache' \
  -H 'Referer: https://skypt.gdcic.net/' \
  -H 'Sec-Fetch-Dest: empty' \
  -H 'Sec-Fetch-Mode: cors' \
  -H 'Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin' \
  -H 'User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36' \
  -H 'sec-ch-ua: "Not;A=Brand";v="8", "Chromium";v="150", "Google Chrome";v="150"' \
  -H 'sec-ch-ua-mobile: ?0' \
  -H 'sec-ch-ua-platform: "Windows"'
  
